/// `impl TryFrom<Box<std::ffi::CStr>>`.
/// THEORY.md §VI.1 one-oracle: the canonical label grammar is named
/// at one site ([`AdmissionTier::as_str`]), inverted at one site
/// ([`<AdmissionTier as std::str::FromStr>::from_str`]), and every
