    /// [`Cow::Borrowed`] branch — the receiver pays the `'static`-
    /// borrow cost of [`From<AdmissionTier> for &'static [u8]`], not
    /// the [`Vec<u8>`]-allocation cost a [`Cow::Owned`] branch
